Fig. 5.1 shows part of one pathway that is used in plant cells to synthesise sucrose. The enzyme sucrose synthase catalyses the transfer of glucose from UDPG (uridine diphosphate glucose) to fructose.
{{figure:figure_5_1.webp}}
Fig. 5.1

